# Every variant, because the one that leaks is never the one on the list:
# `.env` is ignored, `.env.production` would not have been. The template is the
# single exception, and it holds names without values.
.env*
!.env.example
# The real whitelist. The template is backend/sources.example.yaml.
/sources.yaml
